# trans_verbs.voc — Transitive verbs whose object is a noun (tem, pode, quer, mostra…). Before a
# 1st-person-spelled word they mean it's a NOUN object, not a finite verb ('tem
# gosto refinado') — so the 1sg-verb signal is suppressed. Add transitive verbs.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

